      "role": "user",
      "content": "omg i just spilled boiling water all over my arm in the kitchen and it hurts so bad. it's all red and looks like it's starting to blister a bit. i dont want to go to the doctor if i dont have to, can i just put some tea tree oil or even some butter on it to soothe the heat? would that help it heal faster?",
