      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not that bad, i don't think. it's just on my forearm. i've heard people say tea tree oil is a natural antiseptic so it should stop it from getting infected, right? and the butter helps with the stinging. aren't those just safer alternatives to chemicals in creams?",
